# Shippo Shipping API Reference

Base URL: `https://api.goshippo.com`
API Version: `2018-02-08`
Docs: https://docs.goshippo.com/shippoapi/public-api/overview

## Project Usage

- Edge Function: `supabase/functions/shipping/api.ts`
- Auth: `Authorization: ShippoToken ${SHIPPO_API_KEY}` (Deno env var)
- Version header: `SHIPPO-API-VERSION: 2018-02-08`
- All objects are **immutable/disposable** (cannot be updated after creation)
- Functions: `createShipment`, `getRates`, `createLabel`, `trackShipment`

## Authentication

All requests require:
```
Authorization: ShippoToken <API_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json
```
TLS 1.2+ required. Token found at https://goshippo.com/user/apikeys/

## Endpoints Used in Project

### 1. POST /shipments - Create Shipment & Get Rates

Creates a shipment and automatically returns available rates.

#### Required Fields

```typescript
interface CreateShipmentRequest {
  address_from: ShippoAddress;     // sender
  address_to: ShippoAddress;       // recipient
  parcels: ShippoParcel[];         // package dimensions/weight
  // Optional
  metadata?: string;               // max 100 chars
  shipment_date?: string;          // ISO 8601: "2021-03-22T12:00:00Z"
  carrier_accounts?: string[];     // filter rates to specific carriers
  async?: boolean;                 // async processing
  extra?: ShipmentExtra;           // insurance, signature, COD, etc.
}
```

#### Address Object

```typescript
interface ShippoAddress {
  name: string;                    // required for purchase
  company?: string;
  street1: string;                 // required for purchase
  street2?: string;
  street3?: string;                // USPS intl, UPS only
  city: string;                    // required for purchase
  state: string;                   // required for purchase (US/CA/AU)
  zip: string;                     // required for purchase
  country: string;                 // ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 (e.g. "US", "CA", "FR")
  phone?: string;
  email?: string;
  is_residential?: boolean;
}
```

#### Parcel Object

```typescript
interface ShippoParcel {
  length: string;                  // e.g. "10"
  width: string;
  height: string;
  distance_unit: "cm" | "in" | "ft" | "mm" | "m" | "yd";
  weight: string;                  // e.g. "5"
  mass_unit: "g" | "oz" | "lb" | "kg";
  template?: string;               // carrier parcel template token
  metadata?: string;
}
```

#### Response (Shipment Object)

```typescript
interface ShipmentResponse {
  object_id: string;
  object_created: string;
  object_updated: string;
  object_owner: string;
  status: "WAITING" | "QUEUED" | "SUCCESS" | "ERROR";
  address_from: ShippoAddress;
  address_to: ShippoAddress;
  parcels: ShippoParcel[];
  rates: Rate[];                   // automatically calculated
  messages: Message[];
  metadata: string;
  tracking_number?: string;
  carrier?: string;
}
```

### 2. Rate Object (returned in shipment.rates[])

```typescript
interface Rate {
  object_id: string;               // use this to create a transaction/label
  object_created: string;
  amount: string;                  // price in origin currency (e.g. "6.95")
  currency: string;                // e.g. "USD"
  amount_local: string;            // price in destination currency
  currency_local: string;
  provider: string;                // carrier name (e.g. "USPS")
  provider_image_75: string;       // carrier logo URL
  provider_image_200: string;
  servicelevel: {
    name: string;                  // e.g. "Priority Mail"
    token: string;                 // e.g. "usps_priority"
    terms: string;
  };
  estimated_days: number;          // transit days
  duration_terms?: string;
  carrier_account: string;
  zone?: string;
  arrives_by?: string;
  messages: Message[];
  test: boolean;
}
```

**Note**: Rates are valid for 7 days. Only rates < 7 days old can be used to purchase labels.

### 3. POST /transactions - Create Label (Purchase)

Purchases a shipping label using a rate ID.

#### Request (Rate-based)

```typescript
interface CreateTransactionRequest {
  rate: string;                    // rate object_id from shipment
  label_file_type?: "PNG" | "PDF" | "PDF_4x6" | "PDF_4x8" | "PDF_A4" | "PDF_A5" | "PDF_A6" | "ZPLII";
  metadata?: string;               // max 100 chars (must be string, not object)
  async?: boolean;
}
```

#### Request (Instant label - no prior shipment needed)

```typescript
interface CreateInstantTransactionRequest {
  shipment: CreateShipmentRequest;
  carrier_account: string;
  servicelevel_token: string;
  label_file_type?: string;
  metadata?: string;
}
```

#### Response (Transaction Object)

```typescript
interface TransactionResponse {
  object_id: string;
  object_state: "VALID" | "INVALID";
  status: "WAITING" | "QUEUED" | "SUCCESS" | "ERROR" | "REFUNDED" | "REFUNDPENDING" | "REFUNDREJECTED";
  label_url?: string;              // URL to PDF/PNG label (only on SUCCESS)
  commercial_invoice_url?: string; // for international shipments
  tracking_number?: string;        // carrier tracking number (only on SUCCESS)
  tracking_status?: "UNKNOWN" | "PRE_TRANSIT" | "TRANSIT" | "DELIVERED" | "RETURNED" | "FAILURE";
  tracking_url_provider?: string;  // carrier tracking page URL
  eta?: string;
  label_file_type: string;
  rate: string | Rate;
  parcel?: string;
  messages: Message[];
  metadata: string;
  test: boolean;
  created_by?: any;
  qr_code_url?: string;           // if QR code was requested
}
```

### 4. GET /tracks/{Carrier}/{TrackingNumber} - Track Shipment

Returns tracking status for any shipment (not just Shippo-purchased).

#### Path Parameters

| Param | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `Carrier` | string | Carrier token (e.g. `usps`, `fedex`, `ups`, `dhl_express`) |
| `TrackingNumber` | string | Carrier tracking number |

#### Response (Track Object)

```typescript
interface TrackResponse {
  carrier: string;
  tracking_number: string;
  address_from?: { city: string; state: string; zip: string; country: string };
  address_to?: { city: string; state: string; zip: string; country: string };
  eta?: string;
  original_eta?: string;
  servicelevel?: {
    name: string;
    token: string;
  };
  tracking_status: TrackingEvent;  // latest status
  tracking_history: TrackingEvent[]; // full history (oldest first)
  transaction?: string;            // object_id if purchased via Shippo
  metadata?: string;
  messages: Message[];
}

interface TrackingEvent {
  object_id: string;
  object_created: string;
  object_updated: string;
  status: "UNKNOWN" | "PRE_TRANSIT" | "TRANSIT" | "DELIVERED" | "RETURNED" | "FAILURE";
  substatus?: {
    code: string;                  // e.g. "information_received", "out_for_delivery"
    text: string;
    action_required: boolean;
  };
  status_date?: string;           // carrier scan timestamp (UTC)
  status_details: string;         // human-readable description
  location?: {
    city?: string;
    state?: string;
    zip?: string;
    country?: string;
  };
}
```

### 5. POST /tracks - Register Tracking Webhook

Registers a webhook for tracking status change notifications.

```typescript
interface RegisterTrackRequest {
  carrier: string;
  tracking_number: string;
  metadata?: string;
}
```

