## Shipment Extra Options (commonly used)

```typescript
interface ShipmentExtra {
  signature_confirmation?: "STANDARD" | "ADULT" | "CERTIFIED" | "INDIRECT";
  insurance?: {
    amount: string;
    currency: string;
    content: string;
    provider?: "FEDEX" | "UPS" | "ONTRAC"; // omit for Shippo/XCover insurance
  };
  is_return?: boolean;
  saturday_delivery?: boolean;
  authority_to_leave?: boolean;
  billing?: {
    type: "SENDER" | "RECIPIENT" | "THIRD_PARTY" | "COLLECT";
    account?: string;
    zip?: string;
    country?: string;
  };
  reference_1?: string;           // printed on label, max 50 chars
  reference_2?: string;
  delivery_instructions?: string; // FedEx/OnTrac, max 500 chars
  bypass_address_validation?: boolean; // USPS, UPS, LaserShip
  COD?: {                          // UPS only
    amount: string;
    currency: string;
    payment_method?: "SECURED_FUNDS" | "CASH" | "ANY";
  };
  dangerous_goods?: {
    contains: boolean;
  };
  dry_ice?: {
    contains_dry_ice: boolean;
    weight: string;                // kg
  };
}
```

## Pagination

All list endpoints support: `?results=25` (max 100 per page)

## Error Handling

- HTTP 400: Bad request (validation errors in `messages[]`)
- HTTP 401: Invalid or missing API token
- HTTP 404: Object not found
- HTTP 500: Server error (retry with backoff)

## Test Mode

Use your test API token. For tracking tests, use Shippo's predefined test tracking numbers.
See: https://docs.goshippo.com/docs/tracking/tracking/
